hey are tasty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הן טעימות.","en":"They are tasty.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"ילדה טובה.","en":"A good girl.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ילדה יפָה.","en":"A pretty girl.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו יפות.","en":"We are pretty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו יפים.","en":"We are pretty.","alt":["We are beautiful."],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתן עצובות?","en":"Are you sad?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האוכל טעים!","en":"The food is tasty!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האישה שמחה.","en":"The woman is happy.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/9ed55beb4996dd190494bfb04ebef820"},{"he":"התפוז טעים.","en":"The orange is tasty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"התפוח טעים.","en":"The apple is tasty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה לא טעים.","en":"This is not tasty.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זה ספר טוב.","en":"This is a good book.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"מים טעימים.","en":"Tasty water.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"נשים שמחות.","en":"Happy women.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"עוגה טעימה.","en":"A tasty cake.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ילדים יפים.","en":"Pretty children.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אנחנו טובות.","en":"We are good.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הילדה עצובה.","en":"The girl is sad.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"ילדים שמחים.","en":"Happy children.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"היא לא שמחה.","en":"She is not happy.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הצלחות יפות.","en":"The plates are pretty.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"את אישה יפָה.","en":"You are a beautiful woman.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הגברים טובים.","en":"The men are good.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הגברים שמחים.","en":"The men are happy.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הן לא עצובות.","en":"They are not sad.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"זאת עוגה רעה!","en":"This is a bad cake!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האם הן טובות?","en":"Are they good?","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אתם לא עצובים?","en":"Aren't you sad?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האם הם טעימים?","en":"Are they tasty?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"האם הן טעימות?","en":"Are they tasty?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם גברים יפים.","en":"They are handsome men.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זאת משאית רעה.","en":"This is a bad truck.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הם ילדים טובים.","en":"They are good children.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זאת ילדה עצובה.","en":"This is a sad girl.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"היא לא ילדה רעה!","en":"She is not a bad girl!","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הן יפות וטעימות!","en":"They are pretty and tasty!","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"הם רעים, הן רעות.","en":"They are bad, they are bad.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני קורא ספר עצוב.","en":"I am reading a sad book.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"הן נשים והן שמחות.","en":"They are women and they are happy.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הגבינות לא טעימות.","en":"The cheeses are not tasty.","alt":[],"t":"l","inferred":1},{"he":"אני אוכל עוגה טובה.","en":"I am eating a good cake.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אני עצוב והן שמחות.","en":"I am sad and they are happy.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"תודה רבה, לילה טוב.","en":"Thank you very much, good night.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו עצובים, ואתם?","en":"We are sad, and you?","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אתה רואֶה אישה יפָה.","en":"You see a beautiful woman.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אתן שמחות או עצובות?","en":"Are you happy or sad?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו טובים, לא רעים!","en":"We are good, not bad!","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"בוקר טוב או לילה טוב?","en":"Good morning or good night?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הם עצובים, הן עצובות.","en":"They are sad, they are sad.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אתן שמחות או הן שמחות?","en":"Are you happy or are they happy?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"האם היא עצובה או שמחה?","en":"Is she sad or happy?","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"אנחנו רעות, אנחנו רעים.","en":"We are bad, we are bad.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אתן נשים טובות, לא רעות!","en":"You are good women, not bad!","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1}],"hints":{"טוב":"alright / good / ok","שמח":"happy (sg. masc.) / happy / happy (m.s)","זה":"it / it is / it's","רע":"bad / bad (m.s)","כלב":"a dog / dog","את":"it / that / the fruit","שמחה":"happy (sg. fem.) / joy / happy (f.s)","אתה":"you / you are / you (m.s)","הן":"are / they / they are","יפות":"beautiful / pretty / beautiful (f.p)","מים":"water","רעים":"bad (m.p)","הילד":"the boy / the boy is / the kid","הספר":"the book","לילה":"night","אתם":"do you want / you / you are","שמחים":"happy (m.p)","האמא":"the mom / the mother","טובה":"a favor / best / favor","הם":"are / they / they are","טעימים":"are delicious / are tasty / tasty (pl. masc.)","טעימות":"tasty (f.p)","ילדה":"I am a girl / a girl / child","יפָה":"beautiful / beautiful (sg. fem.) / handsome","אנחנו":"we / we are / we (c.p)","יפים":"beautiful (pl. masc.) / handsome / nice","אתן":"you / I will give, allow","עצובות":"sad (f.p)","האוכל":"the food","טעים":"delicious / tasty / tasty (m.s)","האישה":"the woman / the woman is","התפוח":"the apple / the apple is","לא":"aren't / didn't / do not","ספר":"a book / book / tell! (Story)","נשים":"woman / wife / women","שמחות":"happy (f.p)","עוגה":"a cake / cake","טעימה":"tasty (f.s)","ילדים":"boys / children / kids","טובות":"good (f.p) / favour, kindness","הילדה":"the girl / the girl is","עצובה":"sad (f.s)","היא":"her / it / she","הצלחות":"success","אישה":"a woman / wife / woman","טובים":"good (pl. masc.) / good (m.p)","זאת":"it is (feminine) / that / that is (feminine)","רעה":"bad (f.s)","האם":"do / does / is","עצובים":"sad (m.p)","גברים":"men / man","משאית":"truck","רעות":"bad (f.p)","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","קורא":"is reading / read / reading","עצוב":"sad / sad (m.s)","אוכל":"eat / eating / eats","תודה":"thank you / thanks","רואֶה":"is seeing / see / sees","או":"or","בוקר":"breakfast / breakfasts / for breakfast"},"words":[{"he":"האוכל","en":"the food","alt":[],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"שמח","en":"happy (sg. masc.)","alt":[],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sameakh"},{"he":"ספר","en":"book","alt":["a book"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"sefer"},{"he":"האישה","en":"the woman is","alt":["the woman"],"from":"lexicon"},{"he":"שמחה","en":"joy","alt":["happy (sg. fem.)"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"s'mekhah"},{"he":"יפֶה","en":"nice","alt":["beautiful (sg. masc.)","pretty"],"from":"lexicon","tr":"yafeh"},{"he":"רעה","en":"Bad (f.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"ra'ah"},{"he":"יפים","en":"nice","alt":["beautiful (pl. masc.)","handsome"],"from":"skill","tr":"yafim"},{"he":"יפות","en":"pretty","alt":["beautiful"],"from":"skill","tr":"yafot"},{"he":"טובות","en":"Good (f.p)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"tovot"},{"he":"טעימים","en":"are tasty","alt":["are delicious","tasty (pl. masc.)"],"from":"skill","tr":"t'imim"},{"he":"עצובות","en":"Sad (f.p)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"atzuvot"},{"he":"עצובה","en":"Sad (f.s)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"atzuvah"},{"he":"עצובים","en":"Sad (m.p)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"atzuvim"},{"he":"טעימות","en":"Tasty (f.p)","alt":[],"from":"skill","tr":"t'imot"},{"he":"הילד","en":"the boy is","alt":["the boy","the kid"],"from":"phrase"},{"he":"זה","en":"this is","alt":["this","it is"],"from":"phrase","tr":"zeh"},{"he":"טעים","en":"tasty","alt":["delicious"],"from":"phrase","tr":"ta'im"}],"lexemes":["רעה","יפים","יפות","טובות","טעימים","עצובות","עצובה","עצובים","וטעימות","טעימות","יפָה"],"tips":"We use adjectives to describe objects.\n\nSentence Structure\n-----------------\n\nIn Hebrew, the adjective is placed **after** the noun. For example (the adjective is in bold):\n\n**little** dog = כלב **קטן** (kelev **katan**)\n\n-----------------\nConjugation of Adjectives\n-----------------\n\nAdjectives in Hebrew decline according to the grammatical gender and number **of the noun they are referring to**.\n\nAdjective conjugation is almost identical to present tense conjugation. (In fact, you will come to see that the distinction between adjective, verb and noun is very blurred at times in Hebrew!)\n\n- Normal adjective conjugation:\n\n-|Masculine|Feminine\n---|---|---\nSingular| טוב (tov) | טוב**ה** (tov**a**)\nPlural| טוב**ים** (tov**im**) | טוב**ות** (tov**ot**)\n\n- Adjectives that end with the letter \"ה\":\n\n-|Masculine|Feminine\n---|---|---\nSingular| י**פֶ**ה (yaf**e**) | י**פָ**ה (yaf**a**)\nPlural| יפ**ים** (yaf**im**) | יפ**ות** (yaf**ot**)\n\n----------\nSummary of Simple Phrase Structures\n----------\n\nThe book is good - הספר טוב  \nThe good book - הספר הטוב  \nA good book - ספר טוב\n\nHow do we say \"a book is good\"? We use the personal pronouns kind of like a \"to be\" verb:\n\nA book is good - ספר הוא טוב literally \"(a) book he/it (is) good\"\n\nFor a feminine noun, you need to use היא:\n\nA bird is beautiful - ציפור היא יפה\n\nThese a fairly unusual, uncommon sentences in both Hebrew and English, but they serve as an example, and a reminder that ספר טוב almost always means \"(a) good book\" and *not* \"a book is good\".\n\nAnd of course, you need the plural for plural nouns:\n\nChildren/Boys are good - ילדים הם טובים  \nGirls are good - ילדות הן טובות"}